Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:11:47 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add MolmoBot vendor server

Serve MolmoBot DROID checkpoints through the offboard server: memory-mapped weight load into bfloat16, two frames per camera from the previous call, joint step cap and gripper threshold from `FrankaState8ClampAbsPosConfig`, a camera choice per session, and the `droid`, `droid_overlap` and `droid_half_overlap` commands.
